(text "K1 100R, K2 5k, K3 100k, K4 reference: Panasonic TQ2SA-L2-5V dual-coil latching DPDT.\nPole 1: SOURCE_BUF -> RGx. Pole 2: TIA_OUT -> RFx. NC contacts unconnected.\nRESET coils (K1-K4) in parallel on Q2; SET coils on Q3/Q4/Q5/Q6. 1N4148WS flyback per drain.\nK4 reference: COM2 on HCUR, NO2 through R107 1k 0.1% to LCUR (REFCAPTURE, leads unplugged).\nVRLY = 5V through R101 2.2R + C112 22uF. Firmware: source off, RESET 20ms, SET 20ms." (at 20.32 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b30065ca-56d3-5a14-be70-5275f6775e30"))
